            <img src="/icons/swap.svg" class="w-3 h-3 opacity-80 inline-block" alt="" />
            <span>ALTERNATIF SELEVEL</span>
          </span>
          <h3 class="font-headline font-bold text-xs sm:text-base text-slate-900 dark:text-white" id="similar-cars-heading">
            Rekomendasi Mobil Serupa
